1
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,300
Okay,Rach,that's muffin and espresso,$4.50.
瑞秋，鬆餅加濃縮咖啡4塊5 

2
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:09,990
Ross,double latte,$2.75. Chandler,coffee and a scone,$4.25.
羅斯，雙份拿鐵2塊7毛5 錢德，咖啡和小圓餅4塊2毛5 

4
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,640
And Phoebe,herbal tea,$1.25.
菲比，花茶，1塊2毛5

5
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:15,540
All together that's $12.75.
總共是…12塊7毛5

6
00:00:15,910 --> 00:00:20,140
This coming from the man who couldn't split our $80 phone bill in half.
這是80元電話費除以二 不會除的人

7
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:23,580
How much do I owe you?
我的鬆餅和拿鐵多少錢？

8
00:00:23,790 --> 00:00:26,980
That's on the house, courtesy of Joey Tribbiani.
你的由喬伊崔比亞尼免費招待

9
00:00:27,790 --> 00:00:30,120
Great. Well,tell him thanks.
真好，幫我謝謝他

10
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:33,420
And since Joey seems like such a nice guy...
既然喬伊人這麼好 

11
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:35,130
maybe we could go out?
也許我們可以約個會

12
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,890
He's not used to women being so forward...
他不太習慣女人這麼主動 

13
00:00:38,170 --> 00:00:41,000
but I could check with him. He says it's okay.
不過我問過他，他說好

14
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:45,130
Great. Thanks. Bye-bye.
太好了，謝謝，再見

15
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:47,640
How come our stuff isn't free?
喬伊，為什麼我們不是免費？

16
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:51,110
It will be when you look like that in a tight skirt.
等你穿窄裙也那麼辣就可以免費了

17
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:53,640
I'm getting more dates than ever.
真好，我的約會破記錄的多

18
00:00:53,850 --> 00:00:56,820
You're only giving free stuff to the pretty girls?
慢著，你只算美女免費？

19
00:00:57,090 --> 00:00:58,990
Joey,that is so gross!
對啊，好噁心喔

20
00:00:59,750 --> 00:01:02,090
How about a scone on the house,baby?
要不要來一塊免費小圓餅？

21
00:01:04,090 --> 00:01:05,250
I'm pretty.
我是美女

22
00:01:07,660 --> 00:01:09,600
The One With Rachel's Sister
本集播出：「姐妹大比拚」

00:01:11,660 --> 00:01:12,600
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

23
00:01:45,730 --> 00:01:48,570
-Hey,does anyone have any gum? -I do.
有人有口香糖嗎？ 我有

24
00:01:51,340 --> 00:01:52,930
Here. Sorry.
拿一下

25
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:55,710
Oh,you know what?
好像是…

26
00:01:58,450 --> 00:01:59,610
No.
不是

27
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:02,550
Wait a second.
等一下

28
00:02:08,860 --> 00:02:11,790
-I know it's in here. -You know what? I'm good.
我記得我有 算了，不用了

30
00:02:12,490 --> 00:02:14,290
Sorry,I guess it's in my big bag.
抱歉，大概在我的大袋子裡

31
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:19,190
Say,does anybody have a goldfish?
有人有金魚嗎？

32
00:02:23,070 --> 00:02:25,400
Why are you here? Shouldn't you be at work?
你怎麼回來了？不是在上班？

33
00:02:25,610 --> 00:02:28,740
They sent me home. They said I can't work if I'm sick.
他們叫我回家 說什麼感冒不能做菜

35
00:02:30,150 --> 00:02:32,200
-Sorry you're sick. -I'm not sick!
-真可憐 -我沒有感冒

36
00:02:34,150 --> 00:02:38,590
I don't get sick. Getting sick is for weaklings, it's for pansies.
我才不會感冒 軟弱和娘娘腔的人才會感冒

38
00:02:39,790 --> 00:02:41,910
No one thinks that you're a pansy...
沒有人覺得你娘娘腔

39
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:44,960
but we do think that you need a tissue.
但我們覺得你需要面紙

40
00:02:48,060 --> 00:02:50,830
I have not been sick in over three years.
我已經3年多沒感冒了

41
00:02:52,330 --> 00:02:55,560
I think you're sick because that used to be in your nose.
我覺得你感冒了，因為…… 那個原本在你的鼻子裡

42
00:02:58,170 --> 00:02:59,300
I'll get tissue.
我幫你拿幾張面紙 

43
00:02:59,570 --> 00:03:02,670
I don't need a tissue. I'm fine-d.
我不需要面紙，我很好…哪

44
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:05,440
When you put a D at the end of fine...
好的後面還加個哪 

45
00:03:05,750 --> 00:03:07,770
you're not fine.
就是不好哪

46
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,610
I'm fine-d.
我很好…哪

47
00:03:11,750 --> 00:03:13,780
I'm fine-d.
我很好…哪

48
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:17,190
It's a really hard word to say.
這句話很難說

49
00:03:29,940 --> 00:03:33,070
-Yes? -Hi. Is Rachel here? I'm her sister.
-哪一位？ -瑞秋在嗎？我是她的妹妹

51
00:03:33,270 --> 00:03:34,470
Oh,my God,Jill!
天哪，吉兒 

52
00:03:34,940 --> 00:03:36,600
Oh,my God,Rachel!
天哪，瑞秋

53
00:03:37,580 --> 00:03:39,710
Oh,my God,introduce us.
天哪，介紹一下吧

54
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:43,440
This is Chandler. And you know Monica and Ross.
這位是錢德 你認識摩妮卡和羅斯

55
00:03:43,990 --> 00:03:45,920
And that's Phoebe. And that's Joey.
那是菲比，那是喬伊

56
00:03:46,390 --> 00:03:47,910
-How you doing? -Don't!
-你好嗎？ -別……

57
00:03:53,290 --> 00:03:55,420
Honey,what are you doing here?
你怎麼來了？

58
00:03:55,630 --> 00:03:56,790
Which sister is this?
這是哪個妹妹？ 

59
00:03:57,070 --> 00:04:00,000
Is this the spoiled one or the one that bit her?
被寵壞的還是憤世嫉俗的？

60
00:04:00,270 --> 00:04:01,460
Daddy cut me off.
老爸斷了我的財源 

61
00:04:01,670 --> 00:04:03,260
Never mind,I got it.
我知道了

62
00:04:03,770 --> 00:04:05,170
You know what I said?
你知道我怎麼說？

63
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:08,840
I said,"I'll hire a lawyer, sue you,take all your money...
我說 「我要請一個律師 把你的錢都告過來」 

65
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,570
and cut you off!"
「然後斷了你的財源」

66
00:04:10,810 --> 00:04:12,250
Wow. What did he say?
那他怎麼說？ 

67
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:14,240
That he wouldn't pay for my lawyer.
他說不幫我付律師費

68
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:18,150
Then he told me to learn the value of money...
還叫我跟他唯一自豪的女兒

69
00:04:18,420 --> 00:04:20,940
from the one daughter he's actually proud of.
來學學金錢的價值

70
00:04:22,790 --> 00:04:25,590
Did you hear that? My dad's proud of me.
你們聽到了嗎？我爸以我為榮 

71
00:04:25,860 --> 00:04:27,260
My dad's proud of me.
我爸以我為榮

72
00:04:28,130 --> 00:04:29,760
-Rach? -Oh,yeah. Sorry.
-瑞秋？ -好，抱歉

73
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:33,370
Honey,so what did you do that made Dad cut you off?
爸為什麼不給你錢？

74
00:04:34,300 --> 00:04:35,770
Okay,I bought a boat.
我買了一艘船 

75
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,470
You bought a boat?
你買了一艘船？

76
00:04:38,140 --> 00:04:40,160
It wasn't for me, it was for a friend.
不是我要的，是要送朋友的

77
00:04:41,610 --> 00:04:44,040
Boy,did we make friends with the wrong sister.
我們不該跟姐姐交朋友的

78
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:48,680
I knew it was stupid and I shouldn't have done it...
我知道這樣很蠢很不應該

79
00:04:48,850 --> 00:04:52,010
but she bought me all these CDs and said I had a cute haircut.
但她送我一大堆CD 還說我的髮型很漂亮

80
00:04:52,750 --> 00:04:55,620
And your daddy didn't understand?
而你爸卻不能理解？

81
00:04:55,790 --> 00:04:59,890
I know,and usually I just cry and say I'm sorry and he forgives me.
就是啊 通常我哭著道歉就沒事了

82
00:05:00,060 --> 00:05:03,930
Oh,yes,good criers,the Green girls.
沒錯，格林家的女生最會哭了

83
00:05:06,130 --> 00:05:09,730
I mean,the Green sisters.
我是說格林家的姐妹

84
00:05:12,210 --> 00:05:13,610
Man,no matter how you say it...
不管怎麼說...

85
00:05:13,780 --> 00:05:17,400
it still sounds like you're talking about green people.
聽起來都像蛤蜊

86
00:05:18,750 --> 00:05:20,910
I'm at rock bottom.
我真是冷到極點

87
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:25,280
This is the best thing that could've happened to you.
吉兒，這是一次最好的教訓

88
00:05:25,590 --> 00:05:27,680
You've needed to get out on your own.
反正你也得獨立

89
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:31,920
When I did it, at first I was scared, but then look at me now.
我剛獨立時也很害怕 結果現在呢

90
00:05:32,190 --> 00:05:35,420
I am the only daughter that Dad is proud of.
我是唯一讓老爸驕傲的女兒

91
00:05:37,330 --> 00:05:40,030
I can't believe him. How does he expect me to buy stuff?
他真是太扯了 我要怎麼買東西？

92
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:43,190
Maybe,you know, you won't buy stuff for a while.
那你就先不要買東西 

93
00:05:43,370 --> 00:05:45,310
I don't understand.
我不懂

94
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:48,970
This is what you'll do. You're gonna get a job.
你現在要做的是找一份工作 

95
00:05:49,140 --> 00:05:51,080
You're gonna get an apartment.
找一間公寓

96
00:05:51,250 --> 00:05:54,480
And then you will live off the money that you earn.
然後靠你自己賺的錢過活

97
00:05:54,650 --> 00:05:57,520
Okay,I know this is what you did...
好，我知道你是這樣 

98
00:05:57,690 --> 00:05:59,920
but that doesn't sound like me.
但這不像我的作風

99
00:06:01,020 --> 00:06:03,050
Okay,but it can be. It can be you.
但你可以做得到 我會幫你

100
00:06:03,220 --> 00:06:06,250
And you can stay with us. Right,Phoebe?
你可以跟我們住 菲比，可以吧？

101
00:06:06,430 --> 00:06:09,020
-Of course, yeah. -Oh,that's so great!
-當然可以 -太好了

102
00:06:09,260 --> 00:06:12,860
Okay,I'm really gonna do this. I don't know how to thank you.
好，那我就來獨立 真不知道該怎麼謝謝你們

103
00:06:13,070 --> 00:06:15,230
Oh,I like cars.
我喜歡汽車

104
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:22,970
-You all finished? -Yes.
-你吃完了嗎？ -吃完了 

105
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,640
Great.
太好了

106
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:30,920
Okay,here are the tips for this morning.
早上的小費出來了 

107
00:06:31,220 --> 00:06:35,180
Jen gets 50, 50 for me and Joey owes 8 dollars.
珍50，我50 喬伊欠8塊錢

109
00:06:36,820 --> 00:06:39,020
-What? -For all the free food you gave away.
-什麼？ -因為你到處送吃的

110
00:06:39,230 --> 00:06:42,160
If it's free, how come you're charging me for it?
既然是送的，為什麼跟我要錢

111
00:06:43,460 --> 00:06:46,330
We don't give anything away unless it's a birthday.
我們只免費招待壽星

112
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:50,030
What if they came in third in a modeling contest?
那模特兒比賽第三名呢？

113
00:06:51,310 --> 00:06:52,290
No.
不行

114
00:06:52,570 --> 00:06:53,900
Sorry.
抱歉

115
00:06:57,550 --> 00:07:01,140
I just had the hardest day. Some of these are so heavy.
我今天好慘，這些袋子好重

116
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:05,680
How did you pay? I thought your dad took your credit card.
吉兒，你怎麼有錢？ 你爸不是把信用卡都收走了？

117
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:08,480
I memorized those numbers when I was 15.
拜託，我15歲就會背卡號了

118
00:07:09,460 --> 00:07:12,890
But look at all the cool make-it-on-my-own stuff I got!
你們看我買的這些獨立行頭

119
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:16,060
This is my "Please hire me" sweater.
這是「請僱傭我」毛衣N

120
00:07:16,330 --> 00:07:20,360
And these are my "Don't you want to rent me this apartment?" pants.
這是 「你不想把房子租我嗎」褲子

121
00:07:21,440 --> 00:07:26,200
Charging clothes to your dad doesn't qualify as making it on your own.
讓你爸付你的置裝費不算獨立

122
00:07:26,570 --> 00:07:29,570
Oh, Mr. Scientist has to get all technical.
大科學家就是這麼死板

123
00:07:30,510 --> 00:07:33,040
Rachel's not gonna think it's a good idea.
瑞秋真的不會贊成

124
00:07:33,380 --> 00:07:37,340
-So who made her queen of the world? -I would love that job!
-誰封她當女王了？ -我超想當女王的

125
00:07:39,790 --> 00:07:41,190
What's going on?
怎麼樣啊？

126
00:07:41,460 --> 00:07:42,920
Jill!
吉兒

127
00:07:43,930 --> 00:07:45,360
Did you shop?
你跑去逛街嗎？

128
00:07:46,130 --> 00:07:47,560
No.
沒有

129
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:48,960
They did.
是他們

130
00:07:50,630 --> 00:07:52,290
Yeah,we went shopping!
對，我們跑去逛街

131
00:07:54,900 --> 00:07:56,270
You went shopping?
你們跑去逛街？

132
00:07:56,470 --> 00:07:59,630
Then you came here and paraded it under Jill's nose...
然後把東西秀給吉兒看？ 

133
00:07:59,940 --> 00:08:02,640
when you know she's trying to quit. That's terrible.
你們明知她想戒掉 你們真差勁

134
00:08:03,740 --> 00:08:05,140
Sorry,Jill.
抱歉 吉兒

135
00:08:07,450 --> 00:08:08,780
So,what'd you get?
你們買了什麼？

136
00:08:09,050 --> 00:08:11,310
Oh,well,all right. Thank you.
我買了…謝謝N

137
00:08:11,590 --> 00:08:15,280
I got this, you know, "I want a job" sweater.
我買了這件 「我要工作」毛衣

138
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:21,490
And then I got.. These are apartment pants.
還買了這條公寓褲

139
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,620
Apartment pants?
公寓褲？

140
00:08:26,170 --> 00:08:27,570
You've never heard of them?
對，你沒聽過嗎？

141
00:08:28,570 --> 00:08:30,560
Of course I've heard of them.
當然聽過

142
00:08:32,010 --> 00:08:33,630
Ross,what'd you get?
羅斯那你呢？

143
00:08:33,980 --> 00:08:36,270
I got this...
我買了這個…

144
00:08:37,410 --> 00:08:38,840
This.
這個

145
00:08:40,980 --> 00:08:43,780
-A pashmina? -Yeah!
帕什米納（披肩）？ 對

146
00:08:45,350 --> 00:08:48,250
I love these babies.
我愛死它了

147
00:08:51,790 --> 00:08:53,350
Really?
是嗎？ 

148
00:08:53,590 --> 00:08:54,820
What's a pashmina?
帕什米納是什麼？

149
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:57,760
It's a rug.
一種小毯子

150
00:08:59,970 --> 00:09:00,990
Jill?
吉兒？

151
00:09:02,770 --> 00:09:04,900
I'm sorry,Rachel.
瑞秋，對不起…

152
00:09:05,410 --> 00:09:09,810
You think that's gonna work on me? I invented that.
拜託，你真以為我會上當？ 淚眼攻勢是我發明的

153
00:09:10,650 --> 00:09:13,270
Right! But I am sorry.
也對，但我真的很抱歉

154
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:16,940
It's okay. One little setback is okay.
算了，走一次回頭路還好 

155
00:09:17,220 --> 00:09:20,550
-But don't let it happen again,okay? -Okay.
-就是別再犯了，好嗎？ -好。

156
00:09:20,790 --> 00:09:25,120
Now,since Daddy paid for all this stuff, I should take it all away.
既然這是老爸付的錢 我應該全都沒收

157
00:09:25,330 --> 00:09:28,520
But I'm just gonna take the pashmina.
不過我沒收披肩就好

158
00:09:30,830 --> 00:09:33,060
And the pants.
還有那條褲子

159
00:09:33,830 --> 00:09:37,570
I'll take it all, because that way, you'll learn the lesson.
還是都沒收好了 這樣你才能得到教訓

160
00:09:38,410 --> 00:09:39,700
All right.

161
00:09:39,910 --> 00:09:43,670
I'm gonna run a couple of errands and I will see you at dinner.
我有事要忙，我們晚餐見

162
00:09:46,980 --> 00:09:48,920
She took all my stuff.
都被她拿走了

163
00:09:49,180 --> 00:09:53,810
Yeah. Everything but the little blue one.
沒錯，除了這個藍色小袋子

164
00:09:54,060 --> 00:09:55,350
That's the best one!
這一樣最棒了 

165
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:58,150
Oh,my God. Thank you so much!
天哪，謝謝你

166
00:09:58,360 --> 00:10:00,220
Well,hey.

167
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:04,450
Oh,my gosh,that was so lame. Like a pashmina could be a rug.
天哪，你好遜喔 帕什米納怎麼會是小毯子

168
00:10:04,670 --> 00:10:08,360
Oh,yeah? How about you with the "I'm sorry"?
那你呢？「對不起…」

169
00:10:08,570 --> 00:10:10,730
Shut up! I wasn't like that at all.
閉嘴，我哪有那麼噁心

170
00:10:10,940 --> 00:10:15,100
What about what I said about the apartment pants? How dumb was l?
我那個公寓褲呢？夠蠢吧？

171
00:10:18,780 --> 00:10:21,540
-Were you this cute in high school? -Oh,stop.
-你高中時有這麼可愛嗎？ -別鬧了

172
00:10:21,750 --> 00:10:24,220
-No,you stop. -No,you stop.
-你才別鬧了 -你才別鬧了

173
00:10:25,190 --> 00:10:27,750
Why don't I sit here and then you'll both stop it?
你別鬧了 好，我坐中問，你們都別鬧了

175
00:10:31,190 --> 00:10:33,090
Okay. So,what do you want to do?
你想做什麼？

